  "Code examples, JSON Schemas, and machine-readable policy templates are licensed under the MIT License unless otherwise stated. You may deploy them on your own sites freely.": "Mbandu za kodo, ba-schema za JSON, ye mbandu za politiki za kutangwa kwa masini bena ye lisansi MIT, longo vo diambu diankaka disonikwa. Ngeye lenda tula yau va sité yaku mosi kondwa lulendo.",
