  "Correct positioning: independent research drafts, protocol proposals, and an open specification experiment.": "Fulu kia kieleka: mfundu mia nyekolo mia kimpwanza, propozisio za protokolo, ye kimekolo kia spesifikasio kizibukidi.",
  "Corrected an earlier default: Belgium (BE) now maps to Dutch instead of French — Flemish speakers are the country’s majority (~60%) over Walloon French speakers (~40%).": "Yabongoswa kiafwene kiantete: Belgique (BE) buabu keti kwenda kwa ndinga ya Kiholandi ka kwa Kifalanse ko — bavovi ba Kiflamandi i wuki wa nsi (~60%) va ndambu ya bavovi ba Kifalanse ba Wallonie (~40%).",
  "Corrected an earlier default: Kazakhstan (KZ) now maps to Kazakh instead of Russian, now that a Kazakh translation exists — the same kind of fix as the earlier Belgium correction.": "Yabongoswa kiafwene kiantete: Kazakhstan (KZ) buabu keti kwenda kwa ndinga ya Kikazaki ka kwa Kirusi ko, sambu mbalulwa ya Kikazaki yena buabu — mbongoswa yifwene ye yina yavangama kwa Belgique.",
  "Could AI Be Conscious?": "Could AI Be Conscious?",
