  "Draft status": "Kadilu kia Mfundu",
  "EU AI Act: What Actually Applies on 2 August 2026": "EU AI Act: What Actually Applies on 2 August 2026",
  "Educational demo: HMAC-SHA256 with a shared secret, showing request-bound, expiring, verifiable license tokens. Production tokens should be signed asymmetrically, with the publisher’s public key discoverable under /.well-known/.": "Mbandu ya kulonguka: HMAC-SHA256 na mansueki masangana, keti songa tokeni za lisansi zikangama va lomba, zena ye ntangu ya nsuka, ye zilenda fiongononwa. Tokeni za kieleka zifweti sinama mu ndinga yaswaswana, na nzawulu ya kimvuka ya nsonikisi ilenda monwa vana nsi ya /.well-known/.",
  "Eight more /topics entries, this time researched by an AI agent rather than curated by hand — same rule as before: every source fetched and confirmed live, summaries an original paraphrase, before anything gets added. 14 entries total.": "Mambu nana mankaka mekotusu muna /topics, mbala yayi manyekolwa kwa ajan ya AI ka mu moko ko — nsiku dimosi banga kuna: konso kibutu kibakwa ye kisyantikwa mu kimoyo, rezime i masonuku maswaswana, va ntwala ya konso diambu kuyikwa. Mambu 14 va kimosi.",
  "Email": "Imel",
