  "English edition →": "Nkanda wa Kingesi →",
  "Ensure openness is machine-executable — so goodwill is not discarded as legal uncertainty.": "Sikisa vo kuzibuka kulenda salakana kwa masini — mu diambu luzolo luambote lubwa ko banga lukatu lua nsiku.",
  "Epistemology": "Epistemolozia",
